  "job_C7.12_20251003_115409": {
    "chunk_text": "dei quoniam. Monan & steorran on meahte nihte Lunam et stellas in potestatem noctis quoniam. He ofslog mid hira frumbearnum Qui percussit \u00e6gyptum cum primitivis eorum quoniam. & utal\u00e6dde of hire midre Et eduxit israhel de medio eius quoniam. On honda strongre & earme hean in manu forti et brachio excelso quoniam. He tod\u00e6lde \u00feone readan s\u00e6 on tod\u00e6lednesse Qui divisit mare rubrum in divisiones quoniam. & he gel\u00e6dde \u00feurh hire midle Et eduxit israhel per medium quoniam. & he aswengde & his here on \u00f0\u00e6m readan s\u00e6 Et excussit pharaonem et exercitum eius in mari He gel\u00e6dde his folc \u00f0urh westen Qui transduxit populum suum per desertum quoniam. He utgel\u00e6dde w\u00e6ter of \u00f0\u00e6s clifes stane he ofslog micle cyningas Qui eduxit aquam de petra rupis & acwealde wundurlice cyningas Et occidit reges mirabiles quoniam. Cyning Seon regem amorreorum quoniam. & cyning Et og regem basan quoniam. & he sealde hira eor\u00f0an yrfweardnesse Et dedit terram eorum hereditatem quoniam. Yrfweardnesse his \u00f0eowe hereditatem israhel servo suo quoniam. For\u00f0on on ea\u00f0modnesse urre gemyndig w\u00e6s ure dryhten quia in humilitate nostra memor fuit & he alesde us of honda feonda urra Et redemit nos de manu inimicorum nostrorum quoniam. He sele\u00f0 mete \u00e6lcum fl\u00e6sce Qui dat escam omni carni quoniam. Ondetta\u00f0 gode heofones ondetta\u00f0 dryhtne hlaforda for\u00f0on on weorold",
